#: src/meridiana/energy/optimizers.py:466
msgid ""
"Each optimizer tracks the maximum power point of its module (or of its two "
"modules in series, k = 2): the module's power at STC within the optimizer's "
"rated input power, its open-circuit voltage on the coldest morning within "
"the optimizer's absolute maximum input voltage, its short-circuit current "
"within what the optimizer takes; a bifacial module with its front side alone."
