"The menus always above the phases; off, Alt shows them and they go again"
msgstr "I menu sempre sopra le fasi; spento, li mostra Alt e poi se ne vanno"

#: src/meridiana/ui/window.py:885
msgid "Pa&nels"
msgstr "Pa&nnelli"

#: src/meridiana/ui/window.py:886
